\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 \'93There are no such thing as mistakes, only learnings\'94
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 These are some wise words from Susan Augustin (founder of Here We Flo) in my interview with her earlier this year.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 If she\'92s right, I\'92ve made a lot of learnings in how to hire marketing teams and seen a CRAZY amount of learnings in my dealings with other founders!
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 Now I wouldn\'92t have the foggiest how to build an ops team or a sales team or a product team.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 But, I do know a lot about marketing:
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 Built 10+ teams.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 Been a sounding board to 100+ Founders (who\'92s counting?!)
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 I want us to stop making the same mistakes and I genuinely believe all of it comes from a lack of understanding and preparation.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 We all know hiring is expensive, but it\'92s WAY more than you think:\uc0\u8232 \'a0
\f1\fs24 \

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 The time spent recruiting\'a0
\f1\fs24 \

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 The time spent onboarding
\f1\fs24 \

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 The cost of the salary
\f1\fs24 \

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 The toll from the heartache if you get it wrong (for both sides)
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 I want us to make fewer costly mistakes, and to do that we need solid foundations.
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 So I\'92m doing a talk on how to structure a marketing team which you should come to if you are hiring, thinking about hiring or thinking about your future org design.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 I\'92ll talk through how I go from panic mode (I just need someone now!), to a clear overview of the jobs that need to be done.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 There are really key decisions to make.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\
